    counselling: "Type 1 Diabetes is a lifelong condition requiring daily insulin injections. You will learn to check blood sugar, calculate insulin doses, and manage sick days. This is not your fault — it is an autoimmune condition. With proper management, you can live a full, healthy life. Your family and diabetes team will support you.",
